  "pli-tv-bu-vb-sk53:1.1": "Tena samayena . . . Anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-sk53:1.2": "tena kho pana samayena chabbaggiyā bhikkhū pattanillehakaṃ bhuñjanti --pa--. ",
